// a pure-forwarder proxy: all 277 C exports relay to
// `slang-compiler.dll` (recorded in docs/COVERAGE.md). `slang_load`
// resolves every exported oracle symbol fail-fast; when the DLL is
// absent it returns Err(kind = SLANG_LOAD_ABSENT) and the suite SKIPs.

